g","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7h5VB7MlOc99vyg9LZvi1geHLo8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"884761","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"町で音楽自慢大会が開かれるの。私たちも張りきってピアノの練習をしたんだけど、全部バスドラたちの作戦だったなんて！ ネガトーンに追いつめられて大ピンチの私たちの前に、突然仮面のプリキュアが現れて…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-04-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bvoHgz8AZ9NNihzDgvykbV6oRpU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bvoHgz8AZ9NNihzDgvykbV6oRpU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"884762","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"私たちを助けてくれた仮面のプリキュア、キュアミューズ…一体誰なの？ ハミィは新しい仲間だって言うけれど、誰も彼女のことを知らないし。あの目は確かにどこかで見たことがある気がするんだけどな…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y9hxnHvxCjz8vdtx0Y2Fsschkqk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y9hxnHvxCjz8vdtx0Y2Fsschkqk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"884763","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"キュアミューズは一体誰なんだろう。ハミィは、セイレーンがキュアミーズだったら嬉しいって言うんだけれど、セイレーンは悪い事ばかりしてるし…。ハミィとセイレーンのこれまでのこと、聞かせてくれる？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t7J1T18rcg1suLjGAuW76LdWTqW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t7J1T18rcg1suLjGAuW76LdWTqW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"884764","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"奏と学校でキュアミューズを探すことにしたの。きっと音楽を愛する心を持っている子のはずだわ。王子先輩？ 聖歌先輩？ でも、なかなか見つからないの。そんな時、またキュアミューズが現れて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/poUBiBOS7KtyWrn4N8JZb1Oilbz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/poUBiBOS7KtyWrn4N8JZb1Oilbz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"884765","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"王子先輩の誕生パーティーをラッキースプーンで開くことになったの。奏は大張り切り。王子先輩のために最高のカップケーキを作るんですって。みんなで盛り上げて素敵な誕生パーティーになったらいいな。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l0aSLfK8YbEXC6gw39nIwm6jyUC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l0aSLfK8YbEXC6gw39nIwm6jyUC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"884767","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"朝からなんだか奏の様子がおかしいの。ハミィの発案で、仲直りするためにお互いの家に交換ステイすることになったんだけど、奏は毎日お店のお手伝いをしたり、奏太に勉強教えたり、すごく大変なんだ…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-05-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vhIh6JXo0HWwKdYOeCJ7SFd2Wpt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vhIh6JXo0HWwKdYOeCJ7SFd2Wpt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"884766","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ママがフランスに戻る前に、特別に授業参観に来てくれたの。バイオリンを披露したり、一緒にお昼の校内放送をしたり、放課後にはピアノの練習にもつきあってくれて。それから、私が一番好きな場所に一緒に…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-06-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k834WD290Ih0tbRHWdWsE3XiqjP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k834WD290Ih0tbRHWdWsE3XiqjP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"884768","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"今日はなぜか町中に音符がいっぱい!! 音符集めはプリキュアの使命。このチャンスに、音符を大量ゲットして、早く幸せのメロディを完成させなくちゃね。セイレーンたちには負けないわよ！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-06-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mNsih4qBU7gJgYzISdFcB2GW7iv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mNsih4qBU7gJgYzISdFcB2GW7iv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"884769","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"あれ…ハミィがつけているのはセイレーンのネックレス？ きっとセイレーンがハミィに化けたんだわ！ いったいセイレーンは何をたくらんでいるのかしら？ そして本物のハミィはどこに行っちゃったの～!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-06-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/prIzwOaQ787qxaTxZVNwUcexdiY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/prIzwOaQ787qxaTxZVNwUcexdiY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"884770","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"今日のハミィはなんだかごきげんね。でも、その理由はナイショなんだって！ 気になるなぁ～！ 奏太たちが黒いネコと一緒にいたハミィを見かけたって言うんだけど、もしかして黒いネコってセイレーンなんじゃ…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r2AwwDYIdpEJ439idYACJxPDIN3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r2AwwDYIdpEJ439idYACJxPDIN3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.the