age":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-07-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tQxPmXM50wKgcJ6pLdfIrYJyqjt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tQxPmXM50wKgcJ6pLdfIrYJyqjt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"884775","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"今日は加音町の夏祭り。奏と私はお化け屋敷をやるの。エレンも一緒に、と誘ったんだけど…えっ？ エレンはお化けが大嫌いだったの!? どうしよう、私たち、脅かすつもりは全然なかったんだけど…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xk2oLJHPUJzphbuEjRkVyT2TJHZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xk2oLJHPUJzphbuEjRkVyT2TJHZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"884776","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"私たちも負けずに音符を探さなくちゃ。…でもなかなか見つからないなぁ、もうへとへとだよ。そんな時、私たちの前にトリオ・ザ・マイナーが現れた！ しかも、パワーアップしてる!? ドリー、プリキュアに変身よ！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qIBFEU6YIqZQ47f60fMOgMnPhM3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qIBFEU6YIqZQ47f60fMOgMnPhM3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/26"},{"id":"884777","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Episodio 27","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"うわ～、寝ぼうしちゃった～！ 今日はみんなでハイキングなのに！ ハミィ、どうしたの、そんなに慌てて…？ バリトンたちの「トロイの木馬作戦」て何!? 大変、絶対に阻止しなきゃ！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kgz9I7i7G3A3iTU6ypOUEEC4CLM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kgz9I7i7G3A3iTU6ypOUEEC4CLM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"884779","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"Episodio 28","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"もうすぐ始まる新学期。エレンも、音吉さんのおかげで同じ中学校に通えることになったの。よかった！ エレンは嬉しそうだけど、かなり緊張してるみたい…そうだ、みんなで自己紹介の練習をしよう！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gjXv8Hwl1U5GMAvTcpDTxtpYI1U.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gjXv8Hwl1U5GMAvTcpDTxtpYI1U.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"884778","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Episodio 29","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"クレッシェンドトーンから「メイジャーランドに来なさい」というメッセージを受け取った私。魔響の森にあるというヒーリングチェストの力で、弱ってしまったフェアリートーンたちが元気になるって…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yxCF09H5W9GGjOHFH73ucYaxdcd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxCF09H5W9GGjOHFH73ucYaxdcd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"884780","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Episodio 30","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"今日は学校で小テストがあるのに全然勉強できなかった～。よ～し！ クレッシェンドトーンにテストを助けてもらう…のは無理かぁ。ヒーリングチェストって、何に使うものなんだろう。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4NrOV6iVRxTSXMJywx4bh7qejbn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4NrOV6iVRxTSXMJywx4bh7qejbn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"884781","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Episodio 31","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"クレッシェンドトーンの力をちゃんと使いこなせるように…と、私たち、パワーアップのためにキャンプで特訓をすることにしたの！ 空手、ダンス、座禅…いろいろやったけど、なんか違う感じ。私たちに足りないものって…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7BZT6xl8MWInZwpx92nUdo3RaKp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7BZT6xl8MWInZwpx92nUdo3RaKp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"884782","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Episodio 32","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"今日は公演でフリーマーケットが開かれるの。私たちもお店を出すことにしたんだけど…そこにトリオ・ザ・マイナーが現れて、ヒーリングチェストを奪われてしまったの。大変、早く取り返さないと！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-09-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AoqgsPDXshNIVZqLgSLubH2ge4S.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AoqgsPDXshNIVZqLgSLubH2ge4S.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"884783","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"加音町のピアノコンクールに向けて猛練習中！ なんだけど、私が出場すること、パパには言えなくて…。でも、なんとそのパパが審査員!? どうしよう…。私だとバレないようにするには…そうだ、いいこと考えた！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yZkB1MdEnpp5DXItvoWmd7wNT8z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yZkB1MdEnpp5DXItvoWmd7wNT8z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"884784","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"遂にあのメフィストが、マイナーランドからやって来たの！ しかも、私たちをおびき寄せるために、加音町の人たちを悲しませるなんて許せない！ 3人で力を合わせて、さあ、行くわよ！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4D748qBpj2LJzCB8HpBXkejrh3j.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4D748qBpj2LJzCB8HpBXkejrh3j.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"884785","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Episodio 35","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ミューズの守りたいものって、メフィストだったの!? ミューズがメフィストをかばうなんて…！ 私たち、ミューズとも戦わなければならないの？ プリキュア同士で戦うなんて、絶対いやだよ！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vUVerQVAp3we28ode3su1dPwt58.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vUVerQVAp3we28ode3su1dPwt58.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"884786","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Episodio 36","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"アコちゃんがキュアミューズだったなんて…！ そして、メフィストはアコちゃんのパパ!? アコちゃんは、昔のパパは優しかったって言うんだけど、どうしてあんなに変わっちゃったんだろう…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bu4gJYG4hS2oaoQ2nenPAzgBWKq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bu4gJYG4hS2oaoQ2nenPAzgBWKq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"884787","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"プリキュアとして人間界に残ると言うアコに、優しいパパに戻ったメフィストは残念そうだったけど…。そんな中、加音町は明日のハロウィンパーティーの準備でみんな大忙し。みんな仮装して、出かけるよ！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-10-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c2XtXs4ykhoskgjzUg3Dd1qOExP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c2XtXs4ykhoskgjzUg3Dd1qOExP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"884788","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"エレン、ハミィと一緒にラッキースプーンに行ったら、アコがバースデーケーキを注文しに来てたの。そっか、明日は音吉さんのお誕生日！ じゃあ、みんなで歌を歌ってお祝いを！ と思ったんだけど、なぜかアコは歌いたくないって…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-11-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/epsrFduFJNx5gGkpRJhOXmTet9E.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/epsrFduFJNx5gGkpRJhOXmTet9E.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"884790","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Episodio 39","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"大変！ 音符が全部なくなってる!? みんなで集めたのに…ショック。落ち込んじゃうけど…、そうだよ、またみんなで探して集めよう！ ひょっとして音吉さんにパイプオルガンをひいてもらったら、音符たち、出てきてくれるかも!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-11-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rhF4iAKerXXMUR9xCb47mGlWWQh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rhF4iAKerXXMUR9xCb47mGlWWQh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"884789","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Episodio 40","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"音符がなくなってしまったのは、ノイズのせい？ ノイズはこの近くにいるのかな…？ 放課後、みんなと一緒に調べの館へ行ったの。そしたら突然、音吉さんめがけてパイプオルガンが倒れてきて…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-11-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2UQbEtJAyWHhxkr4mxfSiLnH5MP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2UQbEtJAyWHhxkr4mxfSiLnH5MP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"884791","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Episodio 41","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ノイズにたくさん音符を取られてしまって、とうとうファリーが持ってるひとつだけになっちゃった…。しかも、あとこの音符ひとつで不幸のメロディが完成しちゃうの。私たちで絶対、ファリーと音符を守らなきゃ！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/32z2y2dhsKxPMM1EJkBZtaXvXVM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32z2y2dhsKxPMM1EJkBZtaXvXVM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"884792","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"Episodio 42","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"とうとう最後の音符がノイズに奪われてしまったの。不幸のメロディが完成しちゃう…。もうだめだと思っていたけど…アフロディテ様、まだ希望があるって本当ですか？ 私たちが持っているキュアモジューレの中に…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yFhAocdUyRUMJnFOcYz0RSeJQFI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yFhAocdUyRUMJnFOcYz0RSeJQFI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/42"},{"id":"884793","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"Episodio 43","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ファルセットが、アフロディテ様をマイナーランドに連れ去ってしまったの！ 狙いは私たちが持っているキュアモジューレ…。何とかファルセットたちにキュアモジューレを渡さずに、アフロディテ様を助け出さなくちゃ！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eR7LuoO6G5ueqGQysLOldzAiQnr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eR7LuoO6G5ueqGQysLOldzAiQnr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/43"},{"id":"884794","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"Episodio 44","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ついに不幸のメロディの楽譜が完成してしまったの…。プリキュアに変身することもできないし、どうすればいいんだろう…。音吉さんは、パイプオルガンが完成したからもう何も心配ないって言うんだけど…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kAjx9tgvphVcH5UN2CVke5R4xDm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kAjx9tgvphVcH5UN2CVke5R4xDm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"884795","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Episodio 45","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"完全体になったノイズの力で、人々がみんな石にされて、音のない世界になってしまったの…。そして次はメイジャーランドの人たちも!? でも、私たちは絶対あきらめない！ みんなの幸福を取り戻すために！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5WMekLGZRUEUaBrsgggLe3ARl7T.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5WMekLGZRUEUaBrsgggLe3ARl7T.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"884796","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"メイジャーランドのほとんどの人たちが石にされ、音吉さんやクレッシェンドトーンも封印されてしまったの…。でもこんな時こそ音楽の力で…。笑顔で歌ったら、みんな元気になれるはず！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aN5vCiX1dNXxDMHLeV358qGgVgz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aN5vCiX1dNXxDMHLeV358qGgVgz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"884797","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"とうとうメイジャーランドからも音がなくなってしまった…。そして、唯一残った私たちの前に再びノイズが現れて…。ノイズは、全ての音を消し去った理想の世界を作るって言うけれど、彼は一体、何者なの？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a6eT9hkuzMxTAjQ9v6gzhGwpE05.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a6eT9hkuzMxTAjQ9v6gzhGwpE05.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43055/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"884798","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Episodio 48","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ノイズの悲しみが浄化されて、ついに戦いが終わったの。でも、幸福のメロディを歌わないと、メイジャーランドも人間界も全てが石になったまま。